+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception: plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal traffic is held to the same standard as any other, on the basis that proper certificate management is now in place.
